      "alt": "Starterkit STKaRZG2x",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex® A53/A57 based on RZG2x - Series</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKaRZG2x is an evaluation kit designed for embedded computing engineers. It's built on the TQMaRZG2x platform, featuring the Arm Cortex A53/A57 processor from RZG2x Series. This kit is tailored for graphics-intensive applications with 4K support and a 3D engine. It also offers advanced features like 2x MIPI-CSI camera interfaces, LPDDR4 with ECC support, and high-speed communication through 1x Gbit Ethernet, 2x PCIe, 2x USB 3.0 interfaces, and 2x CAN-FD. Integrated safety functions and low power consumption (typically 6W) make it a reliable choice for embedded systems.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 00:59:35 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384"
      ],
